 "story": "\"For myself\" — a self-love anthem visualized as one person''s decision to stop performing for others and reclaim their own time, space, and reflection.", "notes": ["Shristi Rai''s directorial debut for the studio, with Abhi Sampang Rai stepping into the producer''s chair and Samasti Rai handling art direction, design, and makeup in one."], "seo": "Rabil Shrestha Aafno Lagi music video, Aafno Lagi official video, Nepali pop music video"}, {"t": "Niyaali Hera", "a": "Swoopna Suman", "d": "", "y": "2024", "id": "LaRqVQ467xo", "cat": "Music Video", "dop": "Bikesh Magar", "e": "Bikesh Magar", "credits": [{"r": "Cinematographer", "n": "Bikesh Magar"}], "story": "\"Look closely\" — an invitation to really see someone, shot as a soft, gaze-driven visual where the camera lingers the way the lyrics ask you to.", "notes": ["A single-crew production: Bikesh Magar shot, framed, and cut the entire video for one of Nepal''s biggest pop voices."], "seo": "Swoopna Suman Niyaali Hera music video, Niyaali Hera official video, Swoopna Suman new song"}, {"t": "Pagalpan", "a": "Subani Moktan", "d": "", "y": "2024", "id": "p7nkmtRdnto", "cat": "Music Video", "story": "\"Madness\" — love as beautiful irrationality, the kind that makes no sense on paper and perfect sense in person.", "notes": ["_[Crew details not on file — confirm credits before publishing.]_"], "seo": "Subani Moktan Pagalpan music video, Pagalpan official video"}, {"t": "Timi Sangai", "a": "Prabesh Kumar Shrestha", "d": "", "y": "2024", "id": "WLZpjkvR5EQ", "cat": "Music Video", "dop": "Bikesh Magar", "e": "Bikesh Magar", "credits": [{"r": "Associate DOP", "n": "Purushottam Kandel"}], "story": "\"With you\" — a warm, uncomplicated love song about the ease of simply being beside the right person.", "notes": ["A compact two-person camera unit: Bikesh Magar on DOP and edit with Purushottam Kandel supporting."], "seo": "Prabesh Kumar Shrestha Timi Sangai music video, Timi Sangai official video"}, {"t": "Jawaaf", "