FX", "n": "Saurav Shakya"}, {"r": "DIT", "n": "Purushottam Kandel"}, {"r": "Graphics", "n": "Santosh S. Thakuri"}], "story": "\"Our love\" — a long-running love story from one of Nepal''s veteran bands, treated with an anniversary-portrait warmth.", "notes": ["An executive-produced project for legacy band The Edge, combining Saurav Shakya''s VFX with Santosh Shah Thakuri''s graphics work."], "seo": "The Edge Hamro Maya music video, Hamro Maya official video, The Edge band Nepal"}, {"t": "Sahara", "a": "Bipul Mahat", "d": "", "y": "2025", "id": "jsSMgeXPaME", "cat": "Music Video", "story": "\"Support\" — a song of gratitude for the person who holds you up, from Australia-based artist Bipul Mahat.", "notes": ["A cross-border collaboration with an Australia-based artist; Shristi Rai anchored the production on the studio side."], "seo": "Bipul Mahat Sahara music video, Sahara official video, Nepali artist Australia"}, {"t": "Parkhi Rahechu", "a": "John Rai", "d": "", "y": "2025", "id": "Ye8NxLnh8qE", "cat": "Music Video", "story": "\"I keep waiting\" — patience as an act of love; the video sits with the ache of a wait that has no end date.", "notes": ["John Rai''s return after \"K Garu\", this time with Bikesh Magar running the full edit-VFX-color post pipeline."], "seo": "John Rai Parkhi Rahechu music video, Parkhi Rahechu official video"}, {"t": "Bhariya Dai", "a": "J Limbu", "d": "", "y": "2025", "id": "dysQh-Ugyxc", "cat": "Music Video", "keyart": "assets/img/posters/bhariya-dai.jpg", "story": "\"Porter brother\" — a tribute to Nepal''s bhariyas, the load-carriers whose labor built the trails; dignity rendered in sweat and rope.", "notes": ["A socially rooted subject handled with a deliberately small footprint; Bikesh Magar credited on VFX."], "seo": "J Limbu Bhariya Dai music video, Bhariya Dai official video, Nepali porter song"}, {"t": "Tihar Song", "a": "Melonix", "d": "", "y": "2025", "id": "i5Rc8l5C-jo", "cat": "Music Video", "keyart": "assets/img/posters/tihar-song.jpg", "story": "A festival release timed to Tihar — lights, marigolds, and the warmth of the festival of brothers and sisters.", "notes": ["_[Crew details not on file — confirm credits before publishing.]_ Released the week before Tihar 2025."], "seo": "Melonix Tihar Song music video, Tihar song 2025, Nepali festival song"}, {"t": "Prakriti", "a": "Bipul Chettri", "d": "Aakash Poudel", "y": "2025", "id": "chn_GHs_Hy8", "cat": "Music Video", "dop": "Bikesh Magar", "e": "Bikesh Magar & Aakash Poudel", "credits": [{"r": "Assistant Cinematographer", "n": "Kiwa Khimdung Rai"}, {"r": "Stylist", "n": "Samasti Rai & Shristi Rai"}, {"r": "Make-Up", "n": "Samasti Rai"}], "story": "\"Nature\" — Bipul Chettri''s Himalayan folk sensibility given a visual home in landscape, season, and stillness.", "notes": ["One of the studio''s highest-profile artist collaborations to date — Bipul Chettri''s cross-border folk audience spans Nepal, India, and the diaspora. Directed and co-edited by Aakash Pradhan."], "seo": "Bipul Chettri Prakriti music video, Prakriti official video, Bipul Chettri new song 2025"}, {"t": "Angali Deu", "a": "Subid Pun", "d": "", "y": "2026", "id": "c-PPCC45WUc", "cat": "Music Video", "keyart": "assets/img/posters/angali-deu.jpg", "p": "Abhi Sampang Rai", "e": "Bikesh Magar & Abhi Sampang Rai", "col": "Bikesh Magar & Abhi Sampang Rai", "credits": [{"r": "Cast", "n": "Ongdi Moktan"}], "story": "\"Embrace me\" — a plea for closeness carried by Ongdi Moktan''s on-screen performance.", "notes": ["Ongdi Moktan returning to the cast role he began with in \"Parichaya\" — now one of the studio''s most-featured faces."], "seo": "Subid Pun Angali Deu music video, Angali Deu official video"}, {"t": "Samau Mero Haat", "a": "Shuprim Magar", "d": "Aakash Poudel", "y": "2026", "id": "aR8PwgXQvpA", "cat": "Music Video", "dop": "Kiwa Khimdung Rai", "credits": [{"r": "Art Direction", "n": "Samasti Rai"}, {"r": "Stylist", "n": "Bomi Rai"}], "story": "\"Hold my hand\" — a simple gesture as the whole promise; a tender, close-quarters romance.", "notes": ["A four-person unit with Kiwa Khimdung as lead DOP and Aakash Pradhan directing."], "seo": "Shuprim Samau Mero Haat music video, Samau Mero Haat official video"}, {"t": "Aama", "a": "Kesang Tshering Sherpa", "d": "", "y": "2026", "id": "vsp0NFB55rM", "cat": "Music Video", "dop": "Bikesh Magar", "p": "Abhi Sampang Rai", "credits": [{"r": "Cinematographer", "n": "Prabin Gurung & Durga Singh Thakuri"}, {"r": "Art Direction", "n": "Ongdi Moktan"}, {"r": "Production Manager", "n": "Aadi Pahari"}, {"r": "Assistant Production Manager", "n": "Arbind"}, {"r": "Make-Up", "n": "Bomi Rai"}], "story": "\"Mother\" — a tribute to the first and most enduring love; restrained, reverent, and built to make you call home.", "notes": ["New cinematographers Prabin Gurung and Durga Singh Thakuri joined the camera team for this release."], "seo": "Kesang Tshering Sherpa Aama music video, Aama official video, Nepali mother song"}, {"t": "Ghara Ko Kancho Choro", "a": "Samir Shrestha", "d": "Aakash Poudel", "y": "2025", "id": "giRSESKZHrg", "cat": "Music Video", "keyart": "assets/img/posters/ghara-ko-kancho-choro.jpg", "story": "\"The youngest son of the house\" — a wry, affectionate portrait of the family''s kancho: babied, underestimated, and quietly determined to prove everyone wrong.", "notes": ["Aakash Poudel directing under Abhi Sampang Rai''s executive production — the mentorship structure the studio uses to develop new directors."], "seo": "Samir Shrestha Ghara Ko Kancho Choro music video, Kancho Choro official video"}, {"t": "Jay Mahakali", "a": "Balen Shah", "d": "", "y": "2025", "id": "Yse0H0mXEuQ", "e": "Bikesh Magar", "cat": "Music Video"}, {"t": "Maya Ko Aago", "a": "Rockheads", "d": "Abhi Sampang Rai", "y": "2026", "id": "WstiluYoJ7U", "cat": "Music Video", "keyart": "assets/img/posters/maya-ko-aago.jpg", "dop": "Bikesh Magar", "credits": [{"r": "Creative Director", "n": "Devarshi.S"}, {"r": "Assistant Director", "n": "Aakash Poudel"}, {"r": "Art Direction", "n": "Shristi Rai & Ongdi Moktan"}, {"r": "Project Manager", "n": "Aadi Pahari"}, {"r": "Cinematographer", "n": "Prabin Gurung & Durga Singh Thakuri"}, {"r": "Make-Up", "n": "Samasti Rai"}, {"r": "Hair", "n": "Samasti Rai"}, {"r": "Stylist", "n": "Bomi Rai"}, {"r": "Content Manager", "n": "Santosh S. Thakuri & Dipika Rai"}], "story": "\"The fire of love\" — Rockheads'' third ChinoeTales video burns hotter: love as something that warms and consumes at once.", "notes": ["The longest-running band relationship in the catalogue (\"Hajar Janma\", \"Dhun\", now this) — with new crew additions Nurja Rai (styling) and Dipika Rai (content)."], "seo": "Rockheads Maya ko Aago music video, Maya ko Aago official video"}, {"t": "Kherai Jane Maya", "a": "Keher Limbo", "d": "Devarshi.S", "cat": "Music Video", "y": "2026", "id": "a_TAnqNru0Q", "keyart": "assets/img/posters/kherai-jane-maya.jpg", "dop": "Bikesh Magar", "p": "Abhi Sampang Rai", "credits": [{"r": "Cinematographer", "n": "Kiwa Khimdung Rai"}, {"r": "Assistant Director", "n": "Swornima Rai"}, {"r": "Art Direction", "n": "Shristi Rai & Ongdi Moktan"}, {"r": "Stylist", "n": "Bomi Rai & Samasti Rai"}, {"r": "Make-Up", "n": "Bomi Rai & Samasti Rai"}, {"r": "DIT", "n": "Arbind"}], "story": "\"Love gone to waste\" — grieving a love that was spent on the wrong person, shot with more anger than tears.", "notes": ["Swornima Rai''s first assistant-director credit with the studio, under Devarshi Sharma''s direction."], "seo": "Keher Limbo Kherai Jane Maya music video, Kherai Jane Maya official video"}, {"t": "Jhut", "a": "Tala Anjum & Bibash JK", "d": "Bikesh Magar", "cat": "Music Video", "y": "2026", "id": "eAyCZsMFKhM", "e": "Bikesh Magar", "credits": [{"r": "VFX", "n": "Bikesh Magar"}, {"r": "Creative Director", "n": "Abhi Sampang Rai & Devarshi.S"}, {"r": "Creative Head", "n": "Santosh S. Thakuri"}, {"r": "Cinematographer", "n": "Kiwa Khimdung Rai"}, {"r": "Art Direction", "n": "Shristi Rai & Ongdi Moktan"}, {"r": "DIT", "n": "Arbind"}, {"r": "Project Manager", "n": "Aadi Pahari"}, {"r": "Stylist", "n": "Samasti Rai & Bomi Rai"}], "story": "\"Lie\" — a collaboration between Tala Anjum and Bibash JK that pulls apart a relationship built on one; the truth arrives frame by frame.", "notes": ["The studio''s most recent release — a dual-creative-director structure (Abhi and Devarshi) with Santosh Shah Thakuri as creative head."], "seo": "Tala Anjum Jhut music video, Bibash JK Jhoot official video"}], "projects": [{"t": "Ajambari Jhari", "slug": "ahjambari-jhari"}, {"t": "Alvida", "slug": "alvida"}, {"t": "Bhagyamaani", "slug": "bhayemani"}, {"t": "Dhun", "slug": "dhun"}, {"t": "Fijeko Kesh", "slug": "fijeko-kesh"}, {"t": "Fir Kabhi", "slug": "fir-khabi"}, {"t": "Ghara Ko Kancho Choro", "slug": "ghara-ko-kancho-choro"}, {"t": "Hajar Janma", "slug": "hajar-janma"}, {"t": "Hamro Maya", "slug": "hamro-maya"}, {"t": "Hereko Herei", "slug": "hereko-herai"}, {"t": "Hey Sailaa", "slug": "hey-sailaa"}, {"t": "Jay Mahakali", "slug": "jay-mahakali"}, {"t": "Jhim Jhimaune Aankha", "slug": "jhim-jhimaune-aakha"}, {"t": "K Garu", "slug": "k-garu"}, {"t": "Laijau Malai", "slug": "laijaw-malai"}, {"t": "Ma Mare Pani", "slug": "ma-mare-pani"}, {"t": "Maila Dai", "slug": "maila-dai"}, {"t": "Makhamali", "slug": "makhamali"}, {"t": "Maana Ko Haal", "slug": "mana-ko-haal"}, {"t": "Mandainani Mana", "slug": "mandaina-ni-mana"}, {"t": "Maya Ko Aago", "slug": "maya-ko-aago"}, {"t": "Maya Ma", "slug": "maya-ma"}, {"t": "Nindra Ma", "slug": "nindra-ma"}, {"t": "Parichaya", "slug": "parichaya"}, {"t": "Sahara", "slug": "sahara"}, {"t": "Samau Mero Haat", "slug": "samau-mero-haat"}, {"t": "Sisir", "slug": "shisir"}, {"t": "Soltini", "slug": "soltini"}, {"t": "Sparsha Sangeet", "slug": "sparsha-sangeet"}, {"t": "Auchau Vane", "slug": "timi-aauchau-vane"}], "faq": [{"q": "What does Chinoétales Productions do?", "n": "We are a story-driven film studio based in Kathmandu. We direct, shoot, and edit music videos, commercials, documentaries and visual narratives — from the first treatment through to the final grade."}, {"q": "How many people are on the team?", "n": "Thirteen. Direction, cinematography, production design, art direction, editing, styling and the operations that hold it all together are all in-house, and we work with a regular circle of collaborators beyond that."}, {"q": "How many films have you made?", "n": "Over 100 music videos released since 2021, for more than 50 artists and bands."}, {"q": "Do you work outside Kathmandu?", "n": "Yes. We are based in Kathmandu and available for projects anywhere — shoots have taken us across Nepal, and we take on international work."}, {"q": "What does a project usually involve?", "n": "Most begin with a conversation about the song and what it should feel like. From there we build the treatment, assemble the crew, shoot, and deliver the finished film — including the behind-the-scenes cut where the project calls for one."}, {"q": "How do I start a project with you?", "n": "Send us the track and a note about what you have in mind through the contact page. Tell us your timeline and any references, and we will come back to you — we typically respond within 48 hours."}]}'::jsonb, now())
ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET data = EXCLUDED.data, updated_at = now();

